<p>I wrote this because it is so cold and I just want to be away from everything. It is a massive rewrite from user <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/whateverworks" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3674942); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3674942&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1520089135" alt="WhateverWorks" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3674942)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/whateverworks" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3674942); return false;">WhateverWorks</a></span>.</p>
